+```shell
+  ./node_modules/.bin/cypress-tags run -g 'cypress/integration/**/*.feature'
+```
+
+or 
+
+```shell
+  ./node_modules/.bin/cypress-tags run --glob 'cypress/integration/**/*.feature'
+```
+
+or
+
+<span style="color:orange">*DEPRECATED*</span>
+
